{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Electrician Life</strong> is a <u>relaxing simulation game</u> about being an electrician\u26a1 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will take on electrifying challenges as you wire homes, install circuits, and troubleshoot faulty systems. Plan layouts, manage power, and ensure safety in diverse projects. Precision is key\u2014one wrong connection, and it all fails! Can you keep the lights on? \ud83d\udd0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0c <strong>Electricity \u2013 the invisible force that powers the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/extras/2.gif?t=1743708887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> It\u2019s all around us, yet few truly understand how it works\u2026 but now, you do! Step into the role of a skilled electrician and take on electrifying challenges in a realistic yet engaging way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Wire it up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/extras/3.gif?t=1743708887\" /><strong></strong><br><br>\u00a0Take charge of electrical installations from start to finish. Lay cables, install outlets, wire up circuit breakers, and ensure everything runs smoothly and safely. Precision and planning are key\u2014one wrong connection, and the system won\u2019t work as intended!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Design with intelligence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/extras/4.gif?t=1743708887\" /><strong></strong><br><br>\u00a0Plan efficient wiring layouts, manage power distribution, and troubleshoot faulty systems. Use various tools and components to build safe and effective electrical setups. Whether working on a new installation or upgrading an existing one, smart choices lead to the best results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Tackle diverse projects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/extras/1.gif?t=1743708887\" /><strong></strong><br><br>\u00a0Work on various jobs, from wiring new homes to fixing flickering lights and dangerous disasters. Adapt to each client\u2019s needs, stay within budget, and ensure the power flows reliably\u2014because no one likes being left in the dark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Finish the job right.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/extras/5.gif?t=1743708887\" /><br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A true professional leaves no mess behind! Secure cables inside walls, install cover plates, and clean up the work area to perfection. A flawless finish ensures not just a safe installation but a happy customer, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592200?t=1743708887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/87493e237071694f297228e4f435da2641efb31a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743708887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/3d1a1884411b4474d7e7a16f0b26a4112e652a7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743708887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592200/3d1a1884411b4474d7e7a16f0b26a4112e652a7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743708887","categories":[{"d